%% HakiArdhi - Legal Aid Request Flow
%% This flowchart shows how citizens request and receive legal assistance

graph TD
    Start([Citizen Requests Legal Aid]) --> A['Nahitaji msaada wa kisheria'<br/>via WhatsApp]
    A --> B[AI recognizes<br/>legal_aid intent]
    B --> C[Bot collects information:<br/>• Name<br/>• Phone number<br/>• Case type<br/>• Description<br/>• Urgency level]

    C --> D[INTAKE STAGE<br/>Request logged in system]
    D --> E[Case number generated:<br/>HAK-2025-XXXX]

    E --> F[Priority Score<br/>Auto-calculated]
    F --> G{Priority Factors}
    G --> H[• Urgency level]
    G --> I[• Has court date?]
    G --> J[• Case complexity]
    G --> K[• Vulnerable person?]

    H --> L[QUEUE PLACEMENT]
    I --> L
    J --> L
    K --> L

    L --> M[Position: #5<br/>Estimated wait: 2 days]

    M --> N[SMART ASSIGNMENT SYSTEM]
    N --> O{Find Best Lawyer}

    O --> P[Filter by:<br/>✓ Matching specialization<br/>✓ Available capacity less than 20 cases<br/>✓ Same region if possible<br/>✓ Language match]

    P --> Q[Calculate score for each lawyer]
    Q --> R[Select highest scoring lawyer]

    R --> S[Lawyer Assigned:<br/>Advocate Jane Mwangi]

    S --> T1[Citizen receives:<br/>• Lawyer name & contact<br/>• Case number<br/>• Next steps]
    S --> T2[Lawyer receives:<br/>• Case details<br/>• Client contact<br/>• All documents]

    T1 --> U[CASE PROGRESSION]
    T2 --> U

    U --> V[Stage 1: Assessment]
    V --> W[Stage 2: Document Preparation]
    W --> X[Stage 3: Legal Advice Provided]
    X --> Y[Stage 4: Follow-up Support]
    Y --> Z[Stage 5: Resolution]

    Z --> AA{Outcome}
    AA -->|Documents Provided| AB[COMPLETED]
    AA -->|Mediation Successful| AB
    AA -->|Referred to Litigation| AB

    AB --> AC[Status updates sent<br/>via WhatsApp at each stage]
    AC --> End([Case Completed])

    style Start fill:#4CAF50,stroke:#2E7D32,color:#fff
    style N fill:#2196F3,stroke:#1565C0,color:#fff
    style S fill:#FF9800,stroke:#E65100,color:#fff
    style U fill:#9C27B0,stroke:#6A1B9A,color:#fff
    style AB fill:#4CAF50,stroke:#2E7D32,color:#fff
    style End fill:#4CAF50,stroke:#2E7D32,color:#fff
